[metadata]
Name:Rules pilot 446 - Eat before you pay
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your first main phase. You are at 2 life. You control a Food token and a tapped Swamp, with two colorless mana floating, and have Snuff Out (destroy target nonblack creature; if you control a Swamp you may pay 4 life instead of its mana cost) in hand. The opponent is at 20 life and controls Hill Giant. Destroy the Hill Giant this turn and stay alive.
Rule:authored-food-life-then-pay | Food ({2}, {T}, sacrifice: gain 3 life) is an artifact token (CR 111.10b), and a player can pay life only up to their life total (CR 119.4): eat the Food to go to 5, then pay 4 life for Snuff Out and end at 1; at 2 life the alternative cost can't be paid
